messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_dirread.c
Line: 5665
Function: EstimateStripByteCounts
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: If td->td_nstrips is 0, the variable 'strip' is decremented (strip--) and underflows to UINT32_MAX, after which td->td_stripoffset_p[strip] is read. This indexes past the end of the strip offset array, causing an out-of-bounds read. Subsequent code may also read/write td->td_stripbytecount_p[strip] out of bounds.

Source context:
```c
